        "domestic",
        "legal",
        "alternatives"
      ],
      "summary": {
        "zh": "要求撤回，质疑信赖利益及工资影响分析；退而要求保护已在境内者。",
        "en": "Requests withdrawal, challenges reliance and wage analysis, and alternatively seeks grandfathering."
      },
