      "themes": [
        "transition",
        "talent",
        "enforcement"
      ],
      "summary": {
        "zh": "认为取消会将科技与科研人才推向其他国家，主张保留并定向查处滥用。",
        "en": "Argues repeal would drive scientific talent abroad; seeks retention and targeted enforcement."
