        "domestic",
        "enforcement"
      ],
      "summary": {
        "zh": "支持涵盖TN等类别的取消方案，认为临时签证应回归临时用途，并提出资质欺诈指控。",
        "en": "Supports repeal across covered categories including TN, stresses temporary visas, and alleges credential fraud."
      },
