        "finances",
        "legal",
        "transition"
      ],
      "summary": {
        "zh": "要求保留时间处理子女教育、房产和持续医疗，并认为取消会增加紧急申请。",
        "en": "Seeks time for schooling, property, and medical care, and argues repeal would increase emergency filings."
