        "finances",
        "transition",
        "talent"
      ],
      "summary": {
        "zh": "要求保留宽限期，使非自愿失业家庭有时间完成招聘手续并避免子女生活突变。",
        "en": "Seeks retention so families facing involuntary job loss can complete hiring and avoid abrupt disruption to children."
